MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m01_001: Let's get to that underworld gate. It should be right\nat the bottom of these stairs.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m01_002: Don't worry, I'm coming with you. You can count on\nme to have your back.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m02_001: The state of this place... It's like the underworld\nflowed out from the gate and covered the city.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m03_001: It's as I thought. Dagsion is a city of death now.\nIts streets are overrun with the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c01_DN30_001_m04_001: We don't have any reason to go there right now.\nNot until we've seen to that underworld gate.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_001: Promised One. With your help, I was able to deliver\nAurora safely to Dagsion.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_003: From this day forward, I, Corundum Centurio,\nam at your service. Your fight is mine.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_004: When you face the underworld army, I am at\nyour command.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_005: I promise to make an effort worthy of my title.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_006: By the way, Aurora was looking forward to\nseeing you, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CenJoin_m01_007: You will find her at the lower end of Temple Row.\nPlease, grant her a moment of your time.
MID_LGA_3ISM_CenJoin_m01: <BLN>Promised One.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01_001: There's something I need to discuss with you, if you\ndon't mind, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01_002: Aurora's temple in Melias was attacked\nand destroyed.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01_003: If it were to be restored to its former glory, it might\nserve as encouragement for those living nearby.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01_004: And, more than that, access to the Gate of the Gods\nwould doubtless be a boon to our war effort.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01_005: Please—would it be possible for you to assist us\nwith the restoration of Aurora's temple?
MID_LGA_3ISM_ReconstructionTempleAurora_m01: <BLN>Promised One, I have a request...
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_001_m01_001: There is time yet before the gate manifests. Why not\nuse it to ensure we're prepared for the battle?
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_001_m02_001: The gods are fighting valiantly at their respective\ntemples, but even they are overwhelmed.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_001_m02_002: If we could secure the main temples in each region,\nthey would be freer to lend you their aid.
MID_LGA_3ISM_LG30_001_m02: <BLN>The gods are out there...
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m02_001: Behold—an underworld gate. Though it may be some\ntime before it manifests.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m02_002: 'Tis important to keep an eye on gates ready to\nmanifest into our world.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m03_001: You can tell a gate's time is drawing near by the\ndread aura coiling around it, like so.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m03_002: When we see the sign, we must be ready to head\nout to it at a moment's notice.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_GM30_002_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_GM30_002_m01_001: You'll be this army's commander in chief. Form your\nsquads and give them their marching orders.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m04_001: By forming more squads, you can put several of them\nto work at once.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m05_001: Whatever units are left in reserve in Dagsion aren't\nidle, mind you. They gain experience each day.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m06_001: This facility has been destroyed, alas. There's no use\nfor it in its current state.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m06_002: 'Twould be a shame for it to remain in these\nshambles though.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_002_m06_003: If we can provide the right resources, perhaps we\ncould restore it to its former glory.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_002_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_002_m01_001: The main temples across the land came under attack,\nso they can't provide the functions they once did.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_002_m01_002: Jurah, Mars, and the rest went to their main temples\nto help rebuild, but they seem to have met difficulty.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_002_m01_003: If you have the time and ability to spare, help them\nrebuild so that they might return to Dagsion.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_002_m01_004: Even my own temple was not spared...though if you\nrestore it for me, the Supreme Arc there is yours.
MID_LGV_3ISM_TrainingRestart_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_TrainingRestart_m01_001: The arena has been rebuilt, thanks to you. People\nhave been flocking here ever since word got out.
MID_LGV_3ISM_TrainingRestart_m01_002: I'm one of 'em. Starting today, I'm taking over arena\nadministrator duties from my late sister.
MID_LGV_3ISM_TrainingRestart_m01_003: The training grounds have reopened too. But until\nwe fix things up, we'll be training out in the plaza!
MID_LGV_3ISM_TrainingRestart_m01_004: We'll be able to do it properly once the arena's fully\nrestored, but until then, this is what we got.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionArena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionArena_m01_001: I might need your help again a little later.
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionArena_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_ReconstructionArena_m02_001: We need more materials to finish restoring the arena.\nCan you spare anything to help us rebuild?
MID_LGV_3ISM_TempleBalor_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_TempleBalor_m01_001: There is no mistaking Balor's presence here. He waits\ndeep within for his hour to strike.
MID_LGV_3ISM_TempleBalor_m01_002: But ours has not yet arrived. We must first destroy\nall the other gates in order to weaken him.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m01_001: Look there. Do you see the underworld miasma\npouring forth?
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m01_002: The line between this world and the underworld is\nbeginning to blur. We must act swiftly...
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m01_003: else the armies of the underworld will overrun this\narea. We must put a stop to that first.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m02_001: I believe this miasma is tied to the barrier. We ought\nto send squads to dispel it at once.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m02_002: Once we've dispelled all the miasma, the barrier\ntied to it should disappear.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m03_001: Well done in dispelling the miasma barrier.
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_102_m03_002: We've stood idle long enough. Let's be on our way\nto destroy the underworld gate!
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_103_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_103_m01_001: The risen dead have turned their attention to\nDagsion. Are our defenses enough to keep them out?
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_103_m01_002: Always remember that this place is the last bastion\nof hope in our ruined land.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_006_GM_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_006_GM_m01_001: This time, we face two gates ready to manifest.
MID_LGV_3ISM_LG30_006_GM_m01_002: We may need to change our approach to account for\nthem. Attend to your preparations.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c04_GM30_008_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c04_GM30_008_m01_001: Hrm... I sense a far greater danger from that\nunderworld gate than the others.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c04_GM30_008_m01_003: I've no doubt that we'll be met by more enemies than\nusual. We'll need to take the appropriate measures.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c04_GM30_008_m01_002: Send multiple squads there at once and have them\nattack the gate in unison!
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_104_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_GM30_104_m01_001: Multiple gates are manifesting at once. You must not\nfail to deal with them all!
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m01_001: Alright...time to go.
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m02_001: This is the underworld?
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m02_002: Correct. Here in Balor's domain, the laws of common\nsense don't necessarily apply.
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_002_m03_001: As I thought, the risen dead are on the prowl.\nBe ready for a swarm!
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_003_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_003_m01_001: The atmosphere here is strange indeed. 'Tis almost\nas if we're inside the organs of some giant creature...
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_003_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_DN30_003_m02_001: My guess is that stepping inside here will take us\nto our destination...
MID_LGV_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01_001: You can rely on us to protect this place.
MID_LGA_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01: <BLN>You can rely on us.
MID_LGV_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m02_001: No matter what threats we face, I will never back\ndown from my post!
MID_LGA_3ISM_Gatekeeper_Closed_m02: <BLN>I won't let anything through!